termios This module provides an interface to the Posix calls for tty I/O control. built-in
tcgetattr ($module, fd, /) termios Get the tty attributes for file descriptor fd.
tcsetattr ($module, fd, when, attributes, /) termios Set the tty attributes for file descriptor fd.
tcsendbreak ($module, fd, duration, /) termios Send a break on file descriptor fd.
tcdrain ($module, fd, /) termios Wait until all output written to file descriptor fd has been transmitted.
tcflush ($module, fd, queue, /) termios Discard queued data on file descriptor fd.
tcflow ($module, fd, action, /) termios Suspend or resume input or output on file descriptor fd.
tcgetwinsize ($module, fd, /) termios Get the tty winsize for file descriptor fd.
tcsetwinsize ($module, fd, winsize, /) termios Set the tty winsize for file descriptor fd.
